# Safety net for STORAGE_POLICY.md — these types should not be committed at all,
# but if one slips in, treat it as binary so Git doesn't try to diff/merge it as text.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
